FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.26-trixie@sha256:f06b7122f888680048afb247c4e5f49c0069eb6c4c1ccae0f3f4834527a8d22c AS builder

ARG TARGETPLATFORM
ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH
ARG TARGETVARIANT=""
ARG LDFLAGS

ENV GO111MODULE=on \
    CGO_ENABLED=0 \
    GOOS=${TARGETOS} \
    GOARCH=${TARGETARCH} \
    GOARM=${TARGETVARIANT}

COPY . /go/src/github.com/open-policy-agent/gatekeeper
WORKDIR /go/src/github.com/open-policy-agent/gatekeeper/cmd/gator

RUN \
    --mount=type=cache,target=/go/pkg/mod \
    --mount=type=cache,target=/root/.cache/go-build \
    go build -a -ldflags "${LDFLAGS}" -o /gator

FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12@sha256:6447365a6337c3732f412d1b74357b30a633831955b2bc45552b0086be907687 AS build
USER 65532:65532
COPY --from=builder --chown=65532:65532 /gator /gator
ENTRYPOINT ["/gator"]
